nd the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedReaderViewController"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"initializers.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To find the publication an edition belongs to, read"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEPublished\/applicationGUID","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Its name is a frozen API spelling for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the publication GUID, as "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/SearchResult\/applicationId","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is on search"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"results. It’s empty on an edition resolved with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/FeedEditionService\/published(forEditionGUID:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; there, use the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"publication GUID you already hold, such as the one your link or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"notification carried alongside the edition GUID:"}]},{"code":["func publicationGUID(of published: PSEPublished, knownGUID: String?) -> String {","    if !published.applicationGUID.isEmpty {","        return published.applicationGUID","    }","    \/\/ Resolved from an edition GUID: use the GUID you started from.","    return knownGUID ?? published.publicationGUID","}"],"lineAnnotations":[],"copyToClipboard":true,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","wrap":0,"showLineNumbers":false},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/PSEPublished\/publicationGUID","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is the GUID the backend files the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edition’s content under, and it can differ from the publication GUID."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use it only as a last resort, as the last line does."}]},{"anchor":"Replica-Publication-GUID","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Replica Publication GUID"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Identifies a publication on the legacy replica system. Only the prebuilt"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"UI uses it, through a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".replicaArchive(guid:)"},{"type":"text","text":" section or a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/KioskReplicaPublication"},{"type":"text","text":". It looks like a publication GUID; what tells"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them apart is the label PageSuite gave it (see"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Edition-Platforms#Telling-Which-System-a-Publication-Is-On"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A title that moved from the legacy system to the current one has both a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replica publication GUID and a publication GUID, and they’re different"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values. Use the publication GUID for anything on the current system."}]},{"level":2,"text":"Edition GUID","anchor":"Edition-GUID","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Identifies one edition: a single day’s paper, or a single issue. It’s the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier to put in push notifications and links, because it opens an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edition directly without fetc